WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:04.900
No! Let me go!

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.020
Daddy! Daddy, help me!

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.990
Yu-No! Yu-No!

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:26.830
What is this place?

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.420
The quarry.

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:33.290
Or maybe I should say, the prison.

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:39.350
Why is the device from Mt. Sankaku here?

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.440
These prisoners look so lively.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.660
You. Big guy.

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:49.150
What did you do with Yu-No?

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.610
You--

00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:01.410
I'm the warden of this prison. Bazuku.

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.150
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.840
It suits you well.

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:15.380
That necklace is proof that you belong to me.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:19.060
Starting today, you are number 1098.

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:21.930
My name is Takuya Arima! I'm not a number!

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:22.830
Don't--

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:02.780
"Episode 21: The Quarry Where Demons Rule"

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.360
We captured the priestess's heir.

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:05.530
Let me go! Let me go, I said!

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:06.940
Where's Daddy?

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.450
Give him back!

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:10.490
You are in the presence 
of the Divine Emperor.

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:11.990
Calm yourself.

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:14.090
Release her.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:16.530
B-But...

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:21.180
There is nothing to be afraid of.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.010
Get up!

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:42.830
You okay?

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:46.570
You passed out yesterday,
and they threw you in here.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:49.600
I thought you might never wake up.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.070
Where are we?

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:54.790
Our sleeping quarters.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.440
Something wrong?

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:01.590
No...

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.030
Get ready.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.320
You'll be late for breakfast.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:14.980
This is all, huh?

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:16.860
The meat is good!

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.440
It's the one thing we have
to look forward to here.

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.530
Oh, I'm Kartz.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.040
I'm Takuya Arima.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.340
Takuya Arima?

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:28.210
That's a strange name.

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:30.330
I'm Deo.

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:34.210
Is it true that you're the criminal
who defiled the priestess?

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:37.620
I guess...

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:40.800
So, was it good? Well?

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:41.880
Was what good?

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:43.840
You know what I mean.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.260
The priestess's body.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.550
Say that one more time.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:52.730
Calm down. It was a joke.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.460
What did you do to wind up here?

00:04:57.990 --> 00:05:01.590
Me? Well, we can discuss that another time.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:06.560
For now, just know that
I've been here longer than you.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:10.660
And I'm Joe. I've been
here even longer than him.

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:13.000
I'm taking this.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.460
Hey, what the hell?

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:22.060
The rule here is that the
new guy needs to hand over his food.

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:30.550
It's survival of the fittest here.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:53.620
Um, are you okay?

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:56.160
Yeah. He just caught me off guard.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.660
Next time I'll kick his ass.

00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:59.670
Good to know.

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:03.600
But strength alone won't
be enough to survive here.

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:06.420
You need to use this, too.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:10.550
This quarry doesn't have any walls.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.390
And there's barely any guards.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:16.140
It looks like you could escape
without using much brainpower.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.350
I see. Good question.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:21.730
So, let me give you a warning.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:23.650
You! New guy!

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.400
Why aren't you working?

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:28.570
No!

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:33.880
See? You can get away easily.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.460
Just like Mt. Sankaku.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:55.480
Now that you've seen the Tower of Garzel,
you don't need an explanation.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:07:00.440
Don't get any ideas.

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:09.990
Is it psychite that we're digging up here?

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:13.320
Psychite? What's that?

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:18.200
Nope. What we're digging up is "holy stones."

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:23.330
"We"? You haven't done a bit of work.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:27.340
Bazuku appointed me foreman, you see.

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:30.170
Foreman?

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.300
Well, work hard.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.550
Start at the bottom.

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:37.310
And where do I go from there?

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:44.170
The first thing new prisoners
are told to do is dig up the holy stones.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:47.740
Next is crystallizing them.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.240
And the final step in the process is...

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:07.880
These are the coffins of
the priestess, used in the ritual.

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:12.160
And the crystallization work is done here.

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:29.510
I knew it. It looks almost 
just like psychite.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:41.120
--Where did you come from?
--Fresh meat!

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.160
Grab it!

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.080
What's that?

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:47.920
Somebody found a nogard
that wandered into camp.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.240
A nogard?

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:50.900
Let's take our time with it!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.420
This voice...

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:57.360
Kunkun!

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:04.270
What do you think you're doing?

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.940
Are you stealing him from us?

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:07.310
Stealing him?

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.070
We found him.

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:10.440
We get to eat him.

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:11.940
You're going to eat him?

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:16.110
His name's Kunkun.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.070
He used to be my pet!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:20.830
A pet?

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:22.330
Did you hear that?

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:25.330
He said one of the nogard
we use for livestock is his pet!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.040
Livestock?

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:30.090
What, you didn't know?

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:34.260
The meat you're eating here
every day is nogard.

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:38.510
Hey, it's the new kid.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:42.140
Did you forget the rule I taught you?

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:44.680
Of course, I remember.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.050
Right, Kunkun?

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:48.900
Now go!

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:51.150
Hey, wait!

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:55.110
What are you doing?

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.900
Calm down!

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:59.820
If the guards catch you eating a nogard...

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:00.820
Shut up!

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:04.490
Maybe I'll roast you and eat you instead!

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.410
Get away from him!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.270
T-Thank you!

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:16.630
So much noise...

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:18.360
What's all the fuss?

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:21.600
He was trying to eat a nogard they found.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.950
I was telling him not to.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.870
I saw it too!

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:28.020
Well, that's not good.

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:31.390
He'll need to be harshly punished.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.510
No!

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.230
I...

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:47.520
What's he doing to him?

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:50.870
Warden Bazuku is a pervert.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:54.000
It doesn't matter whether
it's a man or a woman.

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:57.510
He feels pleasure when he hurts them.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:00.920
Make sure he doesn't
take an interest in you.

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:03.510
You were so cool back there!

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:05.850
Let me call you "Boss"!

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.640
I've heard that somewhere before...

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:13.150
Amazing, Boss!

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:16.070
They used to call you "Boss" before, huh?

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.230
Yeah, I guess.

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:22.200
But I didn't think anybody
would call me that here.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.120
Is that not okay?

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:27.690
Well...

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.370
Whatever you want.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:34.630
Okay then, Boss!

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:38.290
Anyway, Kartz,
what did you get arrested for?

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:40.310
Um,

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:44.840
Boss... Actually, I'm...

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:46.120
Quiet, Kartz.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:50.050
Everybody has a dark past here.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.500
Let's not ask too many
questions about each other.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:58.610
Okay, Boss, goodnight!

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:12.840
Takuya, how is life in Dela Granto?

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:17.750
It must be painful for you,
considering how easy your life was before.

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:25.960
Dela Granto and Sakaimachi
make contact at 400 year intervals.

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:29.760
Once, they collided physically.

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:35.380
I imagine you're in a place that proves that.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:42.030
Which means it should be
obvious how to escape.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.510
Wake up!

00:12:56.740 --> 00:12:58.280
The Tower of Garzel.

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:03.670
The ruins at Mt. Sankaku
were actually this quarry.

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:05.290
Which means...

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:25.510
These holy stones are definitely psychite.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:29.780
What are you doing?

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:31.740
Nothing...

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:37.670
1098, you're not planning on
stealing the holy stones, are you?

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.310
Of course not.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:47.220
Hey! I didn't take anything!

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:48.770
You can tell, can't you?

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:52.710
I can see you don't appear
to be hiding anything.

00:13:53.630 --> 00:14:01.790
But there are many holes on the body
that could be used to hide a small stone.

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:05.210
I'll check them all.

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:10.320
Stop it! Bazuku!

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:17.830
That damn Bazuku!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:20.170
I'm glad you're okay, Boss!

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:23.510
Though I don't know what he did to you.

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:26.340
Get any new hobbies?

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.010
Of course not!

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.390
Damn it.

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:34.450
I'm getting out of here.

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:36.800
Don't even try!

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:39.480
The Tower of Garzel will fry you!

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:42.610
There's a way out without getting fried.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:47.820
I'll find it!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.440
Boss!

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:52.360
Do you know how many
tunnels there are down here?

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.620
It's a dead end.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.160
You're not going to find it.

00:15:00.340 --> 00:15:04.510
If we escape via the well,
the Tower of Garzel won't attack us.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:07.550
If it takes time, then fine.

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:09.620
I'll find a way out.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:37.240
Kartz told me you've spent
a whole year looking for a way out.

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:41.410
If you find it, let me know.

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.610
Don't get your hopes up.

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:45.880
Of course not.

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:50.760
I tried every tunnel I could find.

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:53.300
This route is the last one left.

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:00.360
This is it!

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.520
I'm sure of it!

00:16:08.520 --> 00:16:11.860
Yes! I finally found it!

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:14.670
Yes!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.790
Hey, I found a way out.

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:22.440
You guys want to come too?

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:32.590
It's a woman!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.050
She's a babe!

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.020
A new prisoner?

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:39.350
I guess so.

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:41.750
Women are rare here.

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.600
Anyway, I'm getting out of here.

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.060
Are you guys coming?

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.260
Um... We'll...

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:50.860
We can't escape yet.

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:52.520
Sorry.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:04.640
Okay.

00:17:18.590 --> 00:17:19.800
There!

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.810
Bingo!

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.510
I knew this was the place!

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:46.110
Survival of the fittest. 
Just like I told you.

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:53.170
Joe... You bastard!

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:15.190
1098!

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:16.630
What are you doing?

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:22.080
Stay there until you learn your lesson.

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.660
Damn it!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:30.750
Feel like confessing?

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:42.300
That's what I want to see
from the resistance leader, Amanda!

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:43.940
Amanda?

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:46.930
That's all for today.

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:01.450
Hey.

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:04.480
Is your name Amanda?

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:06.120
Yes.

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:08.380
I guess I'm famous now, huh?

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:12.670
Ailia told me she had a sister
who was her exact opposite.

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:14.290
My sister told you about me?

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.750
Where is she now?

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:19.590
Is she is annoying as she used to be?

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:24.550
Ailia died as a true knight,

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:28.290
fighting the monsters at the border.

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:31.310
I see...

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:35.410
That's just like her.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:39.410
I don't hear the woman screaming.

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:40.900
Think she's dead?

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:43.480
Bazuku wouldn't kill her that easily.

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:45.200
He'll take his time.

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:46.500
You've got that right.

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:51.210
One of the guards told me that
Takuya was put into the cell next to her.

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:52.540
Then...

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:54.360
They should be talking 
to each other right now.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:20:00.800
Ailia believed in the ritual
to save Dela Granto.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:04.890
I was put in here for the
crime of defiling the priestess.

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:08.140
Good to know.

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:12.730
But the existence of the priestess,
and the ritual, are all lies.

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:14.540
What do you mean?

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:18.500
The Divine Emperor kills the priestess,

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:21.060
and lies and says it's a
ritual done once every 400 years.

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:24.650
That alone is enough to make the people
worship and revere the Divine Emperor.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:27.390
What easier way could there to be to rule?

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:29.870
It's all a lie?

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:34.930
Then Sayless died because this
Divine Emperor guy wanted power?

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:36.750
Correct.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:42.740
The resistance is attempting
to overthrow the Divine Emperor.

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:46.710
Preparations have been made.
Now I must merely give the order.

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:51.550
Takuya, will you help us?

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:56.230
I was on my way to punch
the Emperor in the face.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.240
I have no reason to refuse.

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:04.200
My resistance allies have infiltrated
this place to help me escape.

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.880
Meet with them.

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:08.520
This pose is the sign.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:13.120
Got it. I'll make sure 
to get you out of here.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:22.760
Hey!

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:26.090
Boss!

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:27.720
You're okay, huh?

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:28.800
What about our leader?

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:29.470
Hey.

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:32.760
I figured it was you.

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:35.850
Amanda told me everything.

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:38.090
Let's get out of here.

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:43.240
Right!

00:21:56.370 --> 00:22:00.300
Check. Initiating re-education program.

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:41.610
"Episode 22: Escape from the Quarry"

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:39.750
Episode 22: "Escape from the Quarry."
